<title>FRANCE: AXA has no comment on Alcatel rumours.</title>
<headline>AXA has no comment on Alcatel rumours.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance group AXA-UAP said on Thursday it could not comment on market talk it was selling its shares in Alcatel Alsthom.</p>
<p>&quot;We never comment on market rumours,&quot; a spokesman said.</p>
<p>On Wednesday evening, bank Societe Generale also declined to comment on market talk.</p>
<p>Stockbrokers said there was talk in the market that Societe Generale and AXA were placing their stakes in Alcatel in a deal concerning 14 million shares. A price of 752 francs per share was mentioned.</p>
<p>However, the brokers said they were not involved in the deal and had no concrete evidence.</p>
<p>At 0845 GMT, Alcatel was up 0.39 percent at 765 francs in a turnover of 124 million francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
